        {
          "at": 0,
          "speaker": "Grove Works Hand",
          "text": "Odo's castle sluice is a separate job. This new cut is taking the grove's water; let's test it."
        },
        {
          "at": 5,
          "speaker": "Grove Works Hand",
          "text": "Open the intake alone and read the unsteady mark. Then open the return and take a steady reading. Try both yourself."
