          "text": "The remedy is in place. Keep its cost with the account.",
          "variants": {
            "reserve": "The grove reserve has been spent. The work holds, and that reserve now needs replacing.",
            "material": "The replacement is fitted. One wooden plank is in the work rather than in your pack.",
            "maintenance": "Both crew checks are done. The work holds because a maintenance shift has been assigned."
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 5,
          "speaker": "Odo Fenn",
          "text": "Start with the delivered load. Walk back towards the changed intake, placing removable markers as the evidence supports them."
        },
        {
